
> server@1.0.0 test
> node scripts/test-all.cjs

✔ board serializes and restores without losing structure (3.760083ms)
✔ cloneBoard and reconstructBoard preserve the board snapshot (0.898833ms)
✔ board flags disable Telefon scoring and cross logic in classic101 (0.57175ms)
✔ getGoshaCombo keeps the full score for a double gosha sequence (1.300083ms)
✔ opening [5|5] stops giving 10 points after 300 score (0.099084ms)
✔ placeTile rejects tiles that do not match the selected open end (0.931417ms)
✔ placeTile keeps legal 0/3 placements on the 0 end and exposes 3 as the next open end (0.125125ms)
✔ default board keeps Telefon scoring and cross behavior (0.082ms)
✔ client board round-trip keeps classic101 flags and stays two-ended across serialization (4.971375ms)
✔ client board keeps Telefon cross behavior by default (1.244667ms)
✔ hand with five different doubles is invalid for opening deal (0.102125ms)
✔ Default horizontal mode layout behavior (0.096333ms)
✔ Vertical mode layout behavior for normal tile (0.061834ms)
✔ Vertical mode layout behavior for first double/gosha (0.077ms)
✔ Subsequent moves and score calculation after first double in vertical mode (4.529083ms)
✔ telephone snake avoids self-intersection when right and bottom branches grow together (6.669125ms)
✔ telephone snake remains collision-free for varied 28-tile move orders (47.129125ms)
✔ client and shared board engines choose identical collision-free coordinates (2.869917ms)
